    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "16+ adult content: language, sexual themes. The presentation will be co-presented by the Jeanne & Peter Lougheed Performing Arts Centre and Chester Ronning Centre for the Study of Religion and Public Life at the University of Alberta. About Ivan Coyote’s presentation: Do you still remember every word of every song that ever changed your life? …"
      }
