    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Broadcasting Live on CFCW ***Heads up! Tickets go live to the public Nov. 15!*** Nashville. Music City. Home to legendary music venues like the Grand Ole Opry House, The Ryman Auditorium, Tootsies, and of course the BlueBird Cafe.&nbsp; As a songwriter each one of these world-famous establishments holds a special place in the heart of &hellip;"
