        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rapunzel"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rapunzel, gifted with magically long and glorious hair, has been imprisoned by a nefarious witch in a great tower all her life. But, one day, strangers wander by with a magic of their own that will set Rapunzel Free: music! Let down your hair and welcome AMTC into your schools to experience their hilarious and heart-warming new musical!"
      }
    ],
