        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Ashley Borody as the Ultimate Tribute to Adele Ashley not only looks like Adele but sounds like Adele, she flawlessly captures the essence of Adele’s signature sound which will leave you breathless. Ashley’s powerful voice is one of the most authentic Adele tribute shows touring today. Sold out shows in Canada and USA always ending …"
