        "@value": "Susan is embarking on her 30th Anniversary of This Child Tour with special guest Angela Amarualik, who is also an Inuk artist who was born and raised in Igloolik, Nunavut and has travelled across Canada performing as a throat singer, folk singer, and pop music artist."
      }
