      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Ballet Camrose Dance Company Step into the magical land of Oz with Ballet Camrose Dance Company as we proudly present an enchanting ballet performance of “The Wizard of Oz”! Join Dorothy, Toto, and their unforgettable friends Scarecrow, Tin Man, and Cowardly Lion on a whimsical adventure down the yellow brick road. Our talented local dancers …"
