        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This event is livestreamed. Click here. The Chamber hosts Municipal Election Forums, giving voters the chance to hear directly from candidates, learn their priorities, and ask questions on issues impacting our community and local businesses. The even provides a fair, neutral platform to help residents make informed decisions this election."
      }
