        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This performance is part of the Special Presentations and is show sponsored by Eau Claire Partners – Chelsea Gateman.Media Partners for The Girls is New Country 98.1 and 840 CFCW. Take a walk down memory lane with three of Canada’s most celebrated country music stars! Lisa Brokop (“Take That,” “Better Off Broken,” CCMA Female Artist …"
