        "@value": "The Magic of an East Coast Christmas This performance is part of the BrokerLink Presentation Series and is show sponsored by Bee-Clean Building Maintenance. Celebrating their 35th anniversary this year, beloved multi award-winning Newfoundland &amp; Labrador folk group, The Irish Descendants bring their annual holiday show, The Irish Descendants Christmas to venues throughout Atlantic Canada, &hellip;"
