        "@value": "Featuring Zachary Stevenson with the Rockin&#8217; Royals BandPresented by Paquette Productions From the internationally acclaimed &#8220;Buddy Holly Story&#8221;, Zachary Stevenson performs an exciting tribute to Buddy Holly LIVE in concert. One of the first Rock &#8216;n&#8217; Roll Hall of Fame Inductees, Buddy Holly wrote and performed countless hit songs during the mid-1950s such as &#8220;That&#8217;ll &hellip;"
      }
