      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Camrose & District Music Festival is proud to present our annual Grand Concert celebrating all the participants of the recent festival and featuring performances by a sleection of those festival participants. This event is gratefully sponsored by the City of Camrose Arts Council and is free to the public."
