        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Starring: Amberley Beatty When Amberley Beatty steps onto the stage, the spirit and the very soul of one of the greatest singers in the history of pop and country music comes to life. From the classic western style, to the stunning evening gown, complete with the bright red lipstick, she embodies the sultry sound of …"
