        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tribute Show by White Orchid Promotions Ltd. Direct from the United Kingdom! Get ready to be blown away by the ultimate celebration of some of the most iconic female artists of all time! This multi-diva show is a feast for the senses, featuring the likes of Cher, Madonna, Lady Gaga, Shania Twain, Annie Lennox, Gloria &hellip;"
