    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This performance is part of the BrokerLink Presentation Series and is show sponsored by AdMax Billboards. Hawksley Workman is a JUNO Award-winning and Gold Record certified singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. Since his ground-breaking self-produced indie debut For Him and The Girls (1999) through to chart-topping singles of 2020, Hawksley has careened between major label international smash &hellip;"
