      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This performance is part of the Tracy Brandingen RE/MAX Real Estate Acclaim Series and is show sponsored by Wild Rose Co-op. For over twenty-five years, The Celtic Tenors have enchanted audiences across the globe with their rich harmonies, captivating wit, and heartfelt love for Ireland. Throughout their journey, The Celtic Tenors have topped the charts …"
