    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "18+ NO MINORSVIP $50 + fees (12 tickets available at tables E, D & C) If you would like to purchase VIP tickets, you must call the Jeanne & Peter Lougheed Performing Arts Centre box office at 780-608-2922. Sexy storytelling, performances, and anonymous audience confessions. Sex, (almost) everybody does it and (almost) nobody talks about it …"
      }
