        "@value": "18+ NO MINORSVIP $50 + fees (12 tickets available at tables E, D &amp; C)&nbsp;If you would like to purchase VIP tickets, you must call the Jeanne &amp; Peter Lougheed Performing Arts Centre box office at 780-608-2922. Sexy storytelling, performances, and anonymous audience confessions. Sex, (almost) everybody does it and (almost) nobody talks about it &hellip;"
      }
    ],
