    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Local Bands Helping Local People This is an off-site eventWhere: Days Inn and Conference Center by Wyndham Camrose Norsemen Ballroom &nbsp;In 2016, it came to our attention that some folks in the Camrose musical community had major life changing challenges due to medical trauma and needed support. It was then a few local musicians from &hellip;"
