        "@value": "Presented By Shantero Productions Inc. &lsquo;They&#8217;re on their way, to the city lights&rsquo; &#8230; and, THE predominant Canadian Rock &lsquo;n&rsquo; Roll band of the 1970s &ndash; The Stampeders &ndash; are bringing along all their classic hits: Wild Eyes, Carry Me, Oh My Lady, Devil You, Ramona, Minstrel Gypsy, Hit the Road Jack and, of course, &hellip;"
      }
    ],
