    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Music from the Movies This performance is part of the Tracy Brandingen RE/MAX Real Estate Acclaim Series and is show sponsored by Rose City Fibre Fest. Spectacular Fusion of Orchestral Scores and Iconic Vocals of All Your Favourites From Film! Following last season&rsquo;s sensational cinematic journey, the Edmonton Pops Orchestra is back with MORE! TICKET &hellip;"
