        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "One of Canada’s Most Beloved Comedians! with opener, Nigel Lawrence! This performance is part of the BrokerLink Presentation Series and is show sponsored by OnTrack Kuntz & Company Inc.  Raised in rural Newfoundland Canada, Shaun Majumder has been a performer his entire life. After leaving his hometown of Burlington (Pop 350) and moving to Mississauga …"
