        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "featuring Roger Admiral & The Edmonton Saxophone Quartet Prepare for an experience that defies tradition! Local pianist Roger Admiral joins forces with the Edmonton Saxophone Quartet for an evening that sits at the thrilling intersection of funk, jazz, and classical mastery. Experience a bold new quintet by Alberta composer Howard Bashaw, specifically composed to showcase …"
