        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Attention Elton John fans! Don’t miss Electric Elton – The Music & Legacy of Elton John – arriving in Camrose for the very 1st time on October 3, 2026 @ 7 pm. This unforgettable stage production stars talented vocalist and pianist Sean Trombley, whose powerful and heartfelt performance captures the spirit of early Elton John …"
