        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Multi-award-winning writer and performer Joanna Rannelli of Gravity Theatre is bringing her hit one-woman comedy, Bangs, Bobs & Banter: Confessions of a Hairstylist, to Camrose! Following sold-out runs in Stratford, Vancouver, Edmonton, and Orlando, Joanna embodies Nikki, a charismatic hairstylist with a knack for storytelling. Drawing inspiration from real-life encounters, Nikki invites audiences into her …"
