      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Camrose, our Season Launch 2026 is set for June 11th, 2026! Prepare for the Jeanne and Peter Lougheed Performing Arts Centre’s season launch showcasing one of our Strada Coffee Co. & Artisan Bakery Summer Series artists, Brasstactics, presenting giveaways, and giving you a first-chance look at what shows we’re bringing to Camrose! Plus, you’ll save …"
