        "@value": "“Matt Dusk impressively brings Las Vegas back to the glory days as the standards-singer sounds remarkably like Rat Packer Frank Sinatra‭.‬”‭ ‬ Known for his smooth‭, ‬soulful vocals and magnetic stage presence‭, ‬Dusk and his powerhouse big band will transport audiences to the golden age of swing‭, ‬blending timeless holiday classics with the unforgettable style …"
