    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A unique performing arts venue located on the beautiful, historic University of Alberta’s’ Augustana Campus in the heart of the province."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Viola Desmond, The Soundtrack of a Life Please enjoy the show and stay for a talkback with the artists of the show, hosted by Dr. Joseph Wiebe from the Chester Ronning Centre for the Study of Religion & Public Life. Who is Viola Desmond…? Other than the newest face on Canada’s ten-dollar bill. She is …"
      }
