        "@value": "Viola Desmond, The Soundtrack of a Life Please enjoy the show and stay for a talkback with the artists of the show, hosted by Dr. Joseph Wiebe from the Chester Ronning Centre for the Study of Religion &amp; Public Life. Who is Viola Desmond&hellip;? Other than the newest face on Canada&rsquo;s ten-dollar bill. She is &hellip;"
      }
