      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "When their school cancelled their Christmas Concert, a group of parents got together for their children tokeep the Christmas spirit alive. Presenting the 1st Ever, Community Christmas Concert. A night tohonour the traditions and importance of the Christmas holiday through music. Join us in supporting ourkids as they perform, with some audience interaction. A night …"
