    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&#8220;The show is particularly beautiful, unique and enchanting.&#8221; Catherine Doucet, Ici Radio-Canada Two strange characters appear on stage. They are fluffy, soft, and ageless. Will they find out where they are &#8211; and where they are going? They&rsquo;re waiting&#8230;who? What? They wait while life goes by, looking for something to do&#8230;They take time to look &hellip;"
      }
    ],
