        "@value": "Canada’s Queen of R&B hits Camrose on her Songs and Stories Tour! This is a co-presentation with the Chester Ronning Centre for the Study of Religion and Public Life, and the Jeanne and Peter Lougheed Performing Arts Centre. The Ronning Centre is hosting Jully Black in March 2025 as part of its Black History month …"
