        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This performance is part of the Fountain Tire Family Series. Tickets Available online December 15. Join the Camrose Public Library at 1:00PM before the show starts to make a fun craft with your little one&#8217;s! Will Stroet of Will&#8217;s Jams is a JUNO-nominated musician, nationally recognized educator and former CBC Kids TV star. His high-energy &hellip;"
