        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "You can catch &#8220;Tomatoes Tried To Kill Me But Banjos Saved My Life&#8221; on 3 different dates: October 22 at 7:30PMOctober 24 at 7:30PM October 25 at 3:00PM When faced with a deadly cancer battle, his musical pursuit took him on a journey that became the key to saving his life. Told through authentic storytelling, &hellip;"
